# Project-memory files are never auto-formatted.
#
# .gitattributes marks both of these `merge=union`, which keeps BOTH sides of a concurrent edit
# instead of raising a conflict. That works only because every entry is a self-contained line.
# A markdown table formatter re-pads every row in the table at once, so a re-pad on one branch
# and a new row on another produces a union merge that keeps both copies of every existing row —
# silently duplicating the whole decision log, with no conflict to warn anyone.
#
# Keep these two out of any auto-formatter. See AGENTS.md, "Working agreement".
docs/project/STATUS.md
docs/project/DECISIONS.md
